@startuml
title E Visa Processing And Follow Up System - UML State Machine Diagram

state AccountCreation <<choice>>
state Login <<choice>>
state ApplicationSubmission <<choice>>
state PaymentConfirmation <<choice>>
state ApplicationAcceptance <<choice>>
state StatusView <<choice>>
state StatusCheck <<choice>>
state CancellationRequest <<choice>>
state DetailsModification <<choice>>
state FeedbackGiven <<choice>>
state Logout <<choice>>

AccountCreation:! [*] --> Login: Create Account
Login: [Enter Password] --> ApplicationSubmission: Correct Password
ApplicationSubmission: [Apply for Visa and Pay] --> PaymentConfirmation: Successful Payment
PaymentConfirmation: [Accept Application] --> ApplicationAcceptance: Accepted
ApplicationAcceptance: [View Status] --> StatusView: View Status
StatusView: [Check Status] --> StatusCheck: Checked Status
StatusCheck: [Give Feedback] --> FeedbackGiven: Given Feedback
FeedbackGiven: [Logout or Continue] --> DetailsModification: Modify Details or Logout
DetailsModification: [Save Changes and Logout] --> Logout: Logged Out
CancellationRequest: [Cancel Application] --> Login: Cancelled Application
StatusView: [Cancel Application] --> CancellationRequest: Request Cancellation
Logout: [*] --> AccessEnded: Logged Out
@enduml
